# Strip door, 3 rows of the row mechanism r046 (explore/families ROWS: NE(-4) NE(-2) SW(4) SW(5)
# SW(6), door at x 0..2), every row driven by ideal inputs BEHIND the plane (z = 1), so the three
# rows are independent. Open: E6 D4 C2 C2 D4 C3 E6 D5 C4 (piston by its rest cell, fired at its
# current cell); close: A-4 B-2 C4.
